  unitName: Bellicose Princess Ninmah (EU)
  unitId: 720217
  unitNumber: 7225
  description: "After the events with Enki, which led to the death of Gilgamesh,
    the Princess of Kaiser became the mother of all Shapeshifters by accepting the
    spirit that clung to her. It was this spirit which later on showed her the tragic
    destinies of her descendants through a vision. Ninmah could have chosen to refuse
    the power of the spirit and side with her father. Thus, she would have refused
    to yield to the devouring passion that the gladiator instilled in her to respect
    the Kaiser\u2019s will. Enki would have defied Gilgamesh in single combat. The
    battle would have raged on for days. The invincible Kaiser would have realized
    that he was going to lose, being too old, before this young and ardent fighter,
    and he would start to feel a new sensation: fear. However, the Princess would
    decide to intervene by attacking the gladiator who would have taken a fatal blow.
    Enki would have managed to survive and barely get away. On his part, Gilgamesh
    would strive to recognize his daughter as a powerful warrior. Nevertheless, the
    father and daughter would need to prepare themselves: the ancient gladiator would
    have decreed the most terrible of vengeances. Many years later, some soldiers
    would have reported that a strange army composed of soldiers that transform into
    ferocious beasts was advancing towards the Kingdom of Kaiser..."
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: "I possess my own strength! I don\u2019t need the help of any spirit..."
  evoDesc: "Father\u2026 I am ready to fight! We\u2019ll kill this wicked Enki!"
  element: 2
  rarity: 0
